**/spec/**
**/__mocks__/**
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*
**/*.mock.*

# Documentation
**/docs/**
**/documentation/**
**/*.md
**/*.txt

# Package files (often contain example keys)
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Environment example files
**/.env.example
**/.env.template
**/.env.sample

# Common development files
**/.vscode/**
